  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.1.0 — Add JSON serialization: result.ToJson() and ExcelValidationJson.Serialize(result) render an ExcelValidationResult as JSON (camelCase, enum names as strings). Adds a net10.0 target. No breaking changes from 2.0.\n2.0.0 — Rewritten on ClosedXML (MIT), removing the EPPlus non-commercial licensing restriction. New schema-based API with structured errors. Targets netstandard2.0 and net8.0. See the README for a migration guide from 1.x.",
